        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"76e3a53f-dd0f-4e4a-b824-d7fabf15c53c\",\"review_text\":\"No good experience with it\"},{\"review_id\":\"ae27e598-9e01-48d4-990a-d81ae08f07e8\",\"review_text\":\"Yes the best!!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"4899962f-a07c-42a1-befa-863ecc927fe5\",\"review_text\":\"This app sends 54 years down memory lane , I listen to all my favourites am 64years old\"},{\"review_id\":\"903c565f-e5aa-4945-8d84-91a99b36a6db\",\"review_text\":\"I love it. Now I can listen to my fav songs\"},{\"review_id\":\"b79ffd5c-3f1e-4685-be4e-39cb5e2be9af\",\"review_text\":\"I love listening music on Spotify, it's really a great app for music listeners.😇💕\"},{\"review_id\":\"86e883b9-21cb-419b-aa3f-50d0d989c492\",\"review_text\":\"Listen to anything you want. Great app. Good price.\"},{\"review_id\":\"384d3f2a-3e40-480c-871f-bcb970c5c104\",\"review_text\":\"Why can't we skip to a specific part it's like the most basic human right to do it and u put this feature too in premium, I am telling you if u don't stop this people will have to move on from Spotify, please fix this and no lyrics are showing up this all is so irritating for a music lover\"},{\"review_id\":\"af8bdb13-02f3-4416-91db-6ce96a58572b\",\"review_text\":\"Great im interested on this app why? It's so amazing so I gave it 5 great job\"},{\"review_id\":\"29b15848-3308-4adb-bc24-52d7d00a9afc\",\"review_text\":\"Mostly great, however for some unknown reason it keeps skipping randon songs...a song will start, then just skips onto the next one missing out that song altogether, very annoying. Ive tried deleting cache and lowered the streaming...its still happening\"},{\"review_id\":\"b31c04e0-7750-46bb-9db5-35c9c24156a4\",\"review_text\":\"This is the worst music in my opinion cause it doesn't let me play my liked songs on it and I would give it four stars if it let me play my liked songs but until they fix that it's a one star and I'm most likely going to delete the app\"}]}"
